# Global Rules

{{ include "AGENTS.md" | trim }}

## Codex

- Skills come from plugins (`$<plugin>:<skill>`) and from the shared store at `~/.agents/skills/`, which
  Codex scans natively. A store skill carrying `policy: allow_implicit_invocation: false` in its
  `agents/openai.yaml` is on-demand: it loads only when invoked as `$name`.

